%% title: Where a closed day on the calendar takes effect
%% desc: The Admin adds a closed day to the calendar. The attendance page shows school closed that day and attendance cannot be taken. It is left out of the total days in attendance percentages. The routine holds no classes that day.
flowchart LR
  H["Closed day<br/>on the calendar"]:::admin --> A["Attendance<br/>cannot be taken"]:::teacher
  H --> R["Not counted in<br/>attendance totals"]:::note
  H --> N["No absence<br/>notices sent"]:::guardian
  H --> T["Routine holds<br/>no classes"]:::teacher
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
